Suppose you have weather station that measures temperature
Multiple Devices that need to show the temperature

Basically every device should reflect the same temperature

All these Devices are observer

Observe and Update (Loose Coupling)

Without Observer:
Tightly coupled
1. Need to know about every single device
2. Adding new device means changing code
3. Removing device means changing code
4. It depends on specific types of device


Benefits:
Loose Coupling
Easy to Scale
Flexible at Runtime

Applications:
Event Listeners in Apps
Stock Price Tracking
News Apps and Blogs
Social Media Updates